<h3 id="februus-%E2%80%93-construction-of-conflict-prog-death">Februus &#x2013; <em>Construction Of Conflict</em> (prog death) </h3><p>I get what <a href="https://www.heavyblogisheavy.com/2026/08/31/februus-construction-of-conflict/" rel="noreferrer">Mitchell is saying</a> about the mix on this album being unbalanced, but it doesn&apos;t bother me that much and the guitars are so damn tasty I don&apos;t really care how far forward they are!</p>
<!--kg-card-begin: html-->
