<h3 id="carceral-%E2%80%93-descending-reprisal-instrumental-death-metal">Carceral &#x2013; <em>Descending Reprisal</em> (instrumental death-metal) </h3>
<!--kg-card-begin: html-->
<iframe style="border: 0; width: 100%; height: 120px;" src="https://bandcamp.com/EmbeddedPlayer/album=4294302179/size=large/bgcol=333333/linkcol=e99708/tracklist=false/artwork=small/transparent=true/" seamless><a href="https://i-voidhangerrecords.bandcamp.com/album/descending-reprisal?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Descending Reprisal by CARCERAL</a></iframe>
<!--kg-card-end: html-->
<p><a>Cold Gawd &#x2013; </a><a href="https://coldgawd.bandcamp.com/album/glory2?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Glory2</a> (shoegaze)</p><p><a>A Cold Paradise &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/DOuPLkTk66Q?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">A Cold Paradise</a> (this sucks)</p><p>Consortium Project &#x2013; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Z-KQIaLhUQ&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Consortium Project VI: Legacy of Empires</a> (papyrus prog)</p><p><a>Coward Kill Coward &#x2013; </a><a href="https://hpgd.bandcamp.com/album/i-am-not-a-fighter-i-will-fail?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">I Am Not A Fighter, I Will Fail</a> (blackened noise-sludge)</p><p><a>Djevelsort &#x2013; </a><a href="https://dusktone.bandcamp.com/album/peril-of-freedom?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Peril Of Freedom</a> (meloblack)</p><p>Dominia &#x2013; <a href="https://dominia.bandcamp.com/album/tamas?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Tamas</a> (symphonic black metal)</p><h3 id="dinosaur-jr-%E2%80%93-there-near-alt-rock-grunge">Dinosaur Jr. &#x2013; There Near (alt rock, grunge) </h3>
<!--kg-card-begin: html-->
<iframe style="border: 0; width: 100%; height: 120px;" src="https://bandcamp.com/EmbeddedPlayer/album=3749335951/size=large/bgcol=333333/linkcol=e99708/tracklist=false/artwork=small/transparent=true/" seamless><a href="https://dinosaurjr.bandcamp.com/album/there-near?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">There Near by Dinosaur Jr.</a></iframe>
