<p>Earthlore &#x2013; <a href="https://earthlore.bandcamp.com/album/within-the-earth?from=search&amp;search_item_id=1087725766&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5687989761&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=dbd6b8d281023c587d2249ae96464b17&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Within the Earth</a> (progressive stoner-doom)</p><p><a>Echoes Of A Dying World &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/29UqNYsU4_U?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Revelations</a> (deathened black metal)</p><p><a>Epicardiectomy &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/U6wfjH8GqKA?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Dismal Landscapes of Voluptuous Pustular Cadaverosis</a> (slaming brutal death)</p><p>Evisarize &#x2013; <a href="https://evisarize.bandcamp.com/album/bound-in-flesh?from=search&amp;search_item_id=1786539984&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5687989135&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=39ccd0bdab246850bca8cc5cc536d586&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Bound in Flesh</a> (blackened death-thrash)</p><h3 id="exumer-%E2%80%93-death-mask-messiah-thrash">Exumer &#x2013; <em>Death Mask Messiah</em> (thrash) </h3><figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"><iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/yPF8djVEhN4?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen title="Exumer - Death Mask Messiah (Official Video)"></iframe></figure><h3 id="flotsam-and-jetsam-%E2%80%93-rats-in-the-temple-heavy-thrash">Flotsam And Jetsam &#x2013; <em>Rats In The Temple</em> (heavy thrash) </h3><figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"><iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/DLwxt85T3u0?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen title="FLOTSAM AND JETSAM - Rats In The Temple (Official Video) | Napalm Records"></iframe></figure><p><a>Fane &#x2013; </a><a href="https://fane-la.bandcamp.com/album/armageddon-scars?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Armageddon Scars</a> (sludge doom)</p><p><a>From Under Concrete Kings &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/Q-ygrD_Ds_g?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Impulse Tension</a> (melodic prog-metal)</p><p><a>Glory Of Kings &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/VZ-NwqwF65g?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Roots Of The Past</a> (AI-Gandalf bullshit)</p><p><a>Gorge &#x2013; </a><a href="https://gorgepv.bandcamp.com/album/deeds-of-horror?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Deeds Of Horror</a> (brutal death metal)</p><p><a>Ian Parry&#x2019;s Consortium Project VI &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/5Z-KQIaLhUQ?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Legacy Of Empires</a> (progressive metal)</p><p><a>Ibridoma &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/VME1OYgv8dQ?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Sangue innocente</a> (power/prog metal)</p><p><a>Immiserator &#x2013; </a><a href="https://immiserator.bandcamp.com/album/blight-of-subsistence?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Blight Of Subsistence</a> (black metal)</p><p>In This Moment &#x2013; <a href="https://youtu.be/MjFxtdjyT8E?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com" rel="noreferrer">Witch</a> (who even listens to this?) </p><p>Issa &#x2013; Fire And Ice (Frontiers)</p><p>Jupiter &#x2013; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vcS65qdhki8&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">The Pantheon: Age of Heroes</a> (power metal)</p><h3 id="kamelot-%E2%80%93-dark-asylum-symphonic-power-metal">Kamelot &#x2013; <em>Dark Asylum </em>(symphonic power metal) </h3><figure class="kg-card kg-embed-card"><iframe width="200" height="113" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dp_tiMhEv9c?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen title="KAMELOT - Ashen World (featuring Ignacia Fern&#xE1;ndez)"></iframe></figure><p><a>Kickin Valentina &#x2013; </a><a href="https://kickinvalentina.bandcamp.com/album/anthems-from-the-underground?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Anthems From The Underground</a> (hard rock)</p><p><a>Kulk &#x2013; </a><a href="https://kulk.bandcamp.com/album/choosing-to-die?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Choosing To Die</a> (doomy death-sludge)</p><p><a>Ladrones &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/YGI2OT1xrZ0?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Arriba La L</a> (nu djent)</p><p><a>Laughing Stock &#x2013; </a><a href="https://laughingstock1.bandcamp.com/track/the-story?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Forgotten Dreams</a> (posty prog-rock)</p><p><a>Led By Vultures &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/ry-0M6A_IA8?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Led By Vultures</a> (sludgy rock)</p><p><a>LongFallBoots &#x2013; </a><a href="https://longfallboots.bandcamp.com/album/world-of-thieves?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">World Of Thieves</a> (long sludge)</p><p><a>Mindwork &#x2013; </a><a href="https://mindwork.bandcamp.com/album/adrift?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Adrift</a> (proggy prog-death)</p><p><a>Miscreance &#x2013; </a><a href="https://miscreance.bandcamp.com/album/reminiscence?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Reminiscence</a> (death metal)</p><p>Morgued &#x2013; <a href="https://ironfortressrecords.bandcamp.com/album/ordnance-obscenum-2?from=search&amp;search_item_id=4002539831&amp;search_item_type=a&amp;search_match_part=%3F&amp;search_page_id=5687989606&amp;search_page_no=1&amp;search_rank=1&amp;search_sig=8f412f99a672f3be7bb92a4dbbd9be11&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Ordnance Obscenum</a> (death metal)</p><p><a>Narrow Path &#x2013; </a><a href="https://youtu.be/Azkth1rKTDo?ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Beneath The Sun</a> (hardcore)</p><p>Nekomeshi(222) &#x2013; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p48yiwDXNiE&amp;ref=heavyblogisheavy.com">Convergent Evolution</a> (heavy/prog metal)</p><p><a>Nephilia &#x2013